{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Here I sit, my dear, fulfilling my purpose, namely being in Coblenz, sitting by a window that overlooks the Rhine, my darling, the bridge, and Ehrenbreitstein, eating grapes, but what grapes! the sweetest, most delicious—and thinking of you all together and writing to you. I was at the post office this morning, but found no letter from you; in Cologne, however, I hope, if none more from you is addressed here and reaches me, then to find one. — On Immanuel’s birthday I shall drink an extra glass this noon, and as you will also be drinking to my well-being today, — so let it be hereby formally clinked! — But there is no fine weather today for fireworks; you, in any case, are taking proper care of yourself?). — I certainly do not yet know for sure one main thing, yet I can hardly doubt, namely that our dear mother should be among those celebrating and clinking; she will therefore also be included in the image of the table with which I am clinking. — So, general salvo, universal long live!"}}],"created":1795220569,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":232,"prompt_tokens":349,"total_tokens":581,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-XanBtyvpxUp5t3KVDYCRmWzu7hHJVMOa","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":349,"prompt_ms":456.525,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.3080945558739254,"prompt_per_second":764.4707299709764,"predicted_n":232,"predicted_ms":5400.465,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.378636363636364,"predicted_per_second":42.774094452977664}}